---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | CalcMyLoan"
  description="Learn more about CalcMyLoan, our free browser-based financial calculators, and our mission to make personal finance simple and private."
>
  <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto prose text-slate-700 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">About CalcMyLoan</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>CalcMyLoan.com</strong>, a free collection of fast, accurate, and privacy-first financial calculators designed to help everyday borrowers, homebuyers, and savers make smarter money decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      Most financial websites force you to enter your email address, phone number, or personal credit details just to see a simple loan schedule. We built CalcMyLoan to eliminate that friction. Every calculator on our platform is 100% free, requires zero registration, and lets you export clean PDF reports in one click.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">100% Browser-Based Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      All loan calculations and PDF report generations happen directly inside your web browser. We never upload, store, or sell the financial numbers you enter into our tools.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Educational Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The calculators and guides published on CalcMyLoan are provided strictly for informational and educational purposes. While we strive for mathematical accuracy, figures should not be taken as certified financial, tax, or legal advice. Always consult a licensed financial advisor or lender before signing a loan agreement.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>